# Literal Schreier words for the Rudvalis max4 presentation

The 168-vertex table guides the choice of words only. Each edge is the literal
word rho(i) * a_or_b * rho(j)^-1 in the original two generators. Its rewritten
source loops are valid by telescoping once the endpoint and inverse checks in
`SchreierLifting` are proved. No coset-table faithfulness is assumed here.

Source: original Rudvalis max4 generators and seven words; see `source/README.md` for extraction provenance.
-/

